~~ Our own .af fixture: the same meta as hunt.met, written by hand in metaf's form
~~ (comments, code-folding braces behind comments, blank lines, and the nav section below).

STATE: {Default} ~~ {
	IF:	Always
		DO:	EmbedNav loop {Holtburg loop}
	IF:	MobsInDist_Name 1 25.0 {Drudge}   ~~ one Drudge within 25 yd
		DO:	DoAll
				SetState {Fight}
				Chat {/vt opt set EnableCombat true}
	IF:	All
			MainSlotsLE 2
			Not Death
		DO:	SetState {Sell}
~~ }

STATE: {Fight}
	IF:	Any
			BlockE 8bb30000
			ChatMatch {^You have been}
		DO:	SetState {Default}
	IF:	NoMobsInDist 30
		DO:	DoExpr {setvar[done,1]}
STATE: {Sell}
	IF:	SecsInStateGE 30
		DO:	SetState {Default}

NAV: loop circular ~~ {
	pnt 33.6 42.1 0.39
	pau 33.7 42.0 0.39 5000
	rcl 33.65 41.9 0.39 {Lifestone Recall}
~~ }
